OL,3,GNEWSAFarming union hits out at senior
OL,4,ADefa leadership
OL,5,
OL,6,FA body representing Manx farmers has
OL,7,Fsaid it has lost confidence in the
OL,8,Fgovernment's environment department.
OL,10,FMembers of the Manx National Farmers
OL,11,FUnion (MNFU) on the Isle of Man have
OL,12,Fraised concerns about senior leadership
OL,13,Fin the Department of Environment, Food
OL,14,Fand Agriculture (Defa), and published
OL,15,Fan open letter to the chief minister
OL,16,Fand chief executive of the department
OL,17,Fover concerns about escalating costs
OL,18,Fand diminishing income for farmers.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,451,445,260,140,0,100
