OL,1,W5j 5Q5wsj  ws jkjs j#7kjs57k
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%,.*,$-, *.*  * %** %%* (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFarming union hits out at senior
OL,4,ADefa leadership
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Isle of Man Government pledged to
OL,7,Fmeet the union within the next 10
OL,8,Fworking days to discuss the concerns
OL,9,Fincluding agriculture, farming, and the
OL,10,Fviability of local food production.
OL,12,FThe MNFU said it had "consistently and
OL,13,Frepeatedly raised concerns over trade,
OL,14,Fescalating input costs, declining farm
OL,15,Fprofitability, increasingly restricted
OL,16,Froutes to market and the consequential
OL,17,Fcontraction of agricultural businesses
OL,18,Fwhich in turn deepens risks for the
OL,19,Fislands food security".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
